    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You study the subtle energetic geography of the world, charting the metaphysical leylines and planar conduits that crisscross Eberron. You are trained in Surveying Lore (or another Lore skill if already trained) and ignore non-magical difficult terrain. You gain the <em>Survey the Ley Lines</em> action and can place <em>Waypoint Anchors</em> to guide dimensional movement.</p>"
